I have complete evidence. `sprint_audit.py` already queries `FROM campaigns WHERE mode=...` directly via its own `duckdb` import (line 505), with no `compact.py` dependency. Signal 12 fits the existing pattern exactly. I now have everything needed to write the advisory report.

